        "id": 227524,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-24T19:24:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Depends on the number of players and how early it happens.&nbsp; Some of the B&amp;C Blight cards can strike in round 2 or 3 and it's fine.&nbsp; That's death with the original cards, especially in a 4-player game since you'll have extremely limited reach.</p>",
